<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch bonds end up bolstered by U.S, German data.</title>
<headline>Dutch bonds end up bolstered by U.S, German data.</headline>
<text>
<p>---------------------(Snapshot at 1540 GMT)---------------------</p>
<p>* DUTCH STATE LOANS	 PRICES			  BID YIELDS</p>
<p>  June 1999 7.50 pct	105.99/09 (+0.03)	   4.00 (-0.02)</p>
<p>  Feb  2002		   114.00/10 (+0.24)	   4.70 (-0.06)</p>
